  "Data used to calculate Moving Average / Percentiles is unevenly sampled in TeslaMate. To avoid biases towards more frequently sampled values, the data is bucketed. For buckets without sampled values, the last observed value is carried forward. Bucketing is not time-weighted but is a simple average. Increasing the bucket width results in a loss of accuracy.": "TeslaMate 用于计算移动平均值和分位数的数据采样间隔不均匀。为避免结果偏向采样较密集的时段，先将数据分桶。没有采样值的桶沿用最近一次观测值。分桶采用简单平均，而非按时间加权。增大桶宽会降低准确性。",
