  "Select how Efficiency ratings should be calculated.\n\n\"by distance\" is doing a simple comparison based on distance driven and range lost while driving.\n\n\"slope-adjusted\" takes ascent / descent of the drive into account and adjusts the energy consumed accordingly. regen breaking efficiency is set to 85% and the vehicle is assumed to have a weight of 2100 kg.": "选择行驶效率的计算方式。\n\n“按距离”直接比较行驶距离与行驶过程中消耗的续航。\n\n“考虑坡度”结合行程中的上升与下降高度调整耗电量。能量回收效率按 85% 计算，车辆重量按 2100 kg 计算。",
  "Select last three drives": "选择最近三次行程",
  "Selected Duration": "所选时长",
  "Set Cost": "设置费用",
  "Set cost": "设置费用",
  "Set the capacity of your car battery when it was new, in case you started using TeslaMate after a while of having it. If not, leave it at 0, it will be calculated with the data that is logged in TeslaMate": "如果拥有车辆一段时间后才开始使用 TeslaMate，可在此设置新车时的电池容量。否则保留为 0，系统会根据 TeslaMate 已记录的数据计算。",
  "Set the max range to 100% of your car when it was new, in case you started using TeslaMate after a while of having it. If not, leave it at 0, the degradation will be calculated with the data that is logged in TeslaMate": "如果拥有车辆一段时间后才开始使用 TeslaMate，可在此设置新车时 100% 电量的最大续航。否则保留为 0，系统会根据 TeslaMate 已记录的数据计算衰减。",
  "Shared Buffers": "共享缓冲区",
  "Shares the query result of the Outside Min / Max panel (single positions scan for all four values).": "共享车外最低/最高温度面板的查询结果（一次位置数据扫描获取全部四个值）。",
  "Show charge details": "查看充电详情",
  "Shows how much energy has been recovered through regenerative braking.\n\n\"Energy recovered\" is already included in \"Energy consumed (net)\" and is determined by looking for periods with negative power within your drive. \n\nRequires Streaming API to be enabled and available for this drive.": "显示通过能量回收制动收回的电量。\n\n“回收电量”已计入“净耗电量”，通过查找行程内功率为负的时段确定。\n\n此行程需要启用并可使用 Streaming API。",
